<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Built for the Stacks ecosystem</div>
    <h1>Every wallet on Stacks,<br />one <span>explorer</span> away.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Look up BNS names or addresses to see NFTs, holdings, stacking rewards, and transaction history — then compare wallets side by side.</p>

    <form class="search-shell" action="/search" method="GET">
      <input type="text" name="q" placeholder="Search a BNS name (e.g. muneeb.btc) or STX address…" autocomplete="off" required />
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Explore</button>
    </form>
    <div class="search-hint">Try <a href="/wallet/leather.btc" style="color:var(--accent-strong)">leather.btc</a> or paste any SP… address</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Capabilities</span>
      <h2>One surface for the whole verse</h2>
      <p>Repverse pulls live chain data so you never have to juggle five different tools.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">◈</div>
        <h3>BNS resolution</h3>
        <p>Look up any wallet by its BNS name or resolve an address back to its registered names instantly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">▤</div>
        <h3>NFT holdings</h3>
        <p>See every NFT collection held by a wallet, with counts and quick previews.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">◎</div>
        <h3>Stake calculator</h3>
        <p>Estimate stacking rewards across cycles based on live PoX data and your own APY assumptions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">⇄</div>
        <h3>Transaction history</h3>
        <p>Browse a full, paginated transaction history for any address — sends, receives, contract calls.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">⚖</div>
        <h3>Compare wallets</h3>
        <p>Put two wallets or BNS names side by side to compare holdings, NFTs, and activity at a glance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">$</div>
        <h3>Currency converter</h3>
        <p>Convert STX and other major assets to fiat or crypto in real time, right from the explorer.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card" style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:20px;">
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-size:20px; margin-bottom:6px;">Sign in to save wallets you track often</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14px;">Connect with Google or link your Stacks wallet — no extra password to remember.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:10px;">
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Sign in</a>
        <a href="/compare" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Compare wallets</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
